    hr:executedByProcess hr:ProcDataAccessAuditLogging , hr:ProcPIIEncryptionKeyRotation ;
    hr:mapsToOntologyConcept hr:ConceptDataAccessAuditTrail , hr:ConceptEncryptionKeyRotationPolicy .


